{{!
    @template format_aicourse/activity_cards

    The activity card grid for a single section: a grid of activity cards, then the full-width
    content rows produced by url-less content modules ("Text and media area"), then an empty state
    when the section shows nothing at all.

    The container is a named landmark region and carries a real <h2> so the <h3> activity names sit
    at the correct depth under the page <h1>. The heading is suppressed when the caller (the
    General section block) has already emitted one for the same section. Every decorative SVG
    carries aria-hidden="true" focusable="false".

    Classes required for JS:
    * aicourse-activity-cards-grid

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-for="cmlist" and data-id on the grid - the attributes core_courseformat's reactive state
      manager binds to so activity move/visibility mutations can update the grid.
    * data-cmid on each content row.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * notfound bool True when the requested section does not exist; only the empty state is drawn.
    * regionlabel string Accessible name of the region (the section name, plain text).
    * showheading bool True when the region <h2> should be rendered.
    * sectionname string PRE-ESCAPED section name (already through format_string()); rendered with
      a triple mustache so the entities format_string() produced are not escaped twice.
    * sectionid int Section record ID, used as the reactive cmlist owner.
    * cards array List of contexts for format_aicourse/activity_card.
    * contentrows array Objects with cmid and content. content is PRE-ESCAPED HTML from
      cm_info::get_formatted_content(), i.e. it has already been through format_text(), so it is
      rendered with a triple mustache.
    * isempty bool True when the section rendered no activities at all.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "notfound": false,
        "regionlabel": "Module 1: Foundations",
        "showheading": true,
        "sectionname": "Module 1: Foundations",
        "sectionid": 35,
        "cards": [
            {
                "issubsection": false,
                "cmid": 12,
                "url": "https://example.org/mod/page/view.php?id=12",
                "status": "completed",
                "haslabel": true,
                "cardlabel": "What is machine learning? (Completed)",
                "iconurl": "https://example.org/theme/image.php/boost/page/1/monologo",
                "name": "What is machine learning?",
                "typename": "Page",
                "iscompleted": true,
                "statuslabel": "Completed",
                "badgeclass": "aicourse-status-badge-completed"
            }
        ],
        "contentrows": [
            {
                "cmid": 19,
                "content": "<div class=\"no-overflow\"><p>Read this first.</p></div>"
            }
        ],
        "isempty": false
    }
}}
{{#notfound}}
<div class="aicourse-activity-cards-container">
<div class="aicourse-empty-state">
<p>{{#str}} sectionnotfound, format_aicourse {{/str}}</p>
</div>
</div>
{{/notfound}}
{{^notfound}}
<div class="aicourse-activity-cards-container" role="region" aria-label="{{regionlabel}}">
{{#showheading}}
<h2 class="aicourse-activity-cards-heading accesshide">{{{sectionname}}}</h2>
{{/showheading}}
<div class="aicourse-activity-cards-grid" data-for="cmlist" data-id="{{sectionid}}">
{{#cards}}
{{> format_aicourse/activity_card }}
{{/cards}}
</div>
{{#contentrows}}
<div class="aicourse-activity-content-row" data-cmid="{{cmid}}"><div class="aicourse-activity-content">{{{content}}}</div></div>
{{/contentrows}}
{{#isempty}}
<div class="aicourse-empty-state">
<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="opacity:0.4;margin-bottom:12px"><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="14" rx="1"/><path d="M14 4h7"/><path d="M14 9h7"/><path d="M14 15h7"/><path d="M14 20h7"/></svg>
<p>{{#str}} noactivitiesinsection, format_aicourse {{/str}}</p>
</div>
{{/isempty}}
</div>
{{/notfound}}
